 # APEX Test Studio
 
-Upload an Excel file of test cases, run them against your Oracle APEX app, watch live PASS/FAIL, and replay every execution video.
-**All data lives in PostgreSQL** (workbooks, runs, results, videos, screenshots, settings, history). Nothing is stored on disk.
+Test **any Oracle APEX application** as **every user role**: register the app, add a test user per role, and each test runs
+once per user - sign in automatically, run, record a video, sign out, next user in a clean browser.
+Excel test cases, the visual test builder, the video wall and run history all keep working.
+**All data lives in PostgreSQL**; passwords never do (see *Passwords* below).
 
 ## Setup (once)
     cd backend
